msgid "Servo Shield"
msgstr "Servo Shield"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/servo-shield-old.rst:4
msgid ""
"The Servo Shield drives up to eight hobby servos in parallel from the OpenMV"
" Cam over I2C, using a PCA9685 servo / PWM controller."
msgstr ""
"Servo Shield 使用 PCA9685 伺服／PWM 控制器，可透過 I2C 從 OpenMV Cam 並聯驅動最多八個玩具級伺服馬達。"

